      "segments_before": {
        "s01": "We beseech You, O Lord, that having received Your gifts, each partaking of this sacrament may increase within us its saving effects. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, forever and ever.",
        "s02": "Amen."
      },
      "segments_after": {
        "s01": "Having received the sacred gifts, we beseech You, Lord, that the fruit of our salvation may grow with our frequent participation in this mystery. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, forever and ever.",
        "s02": "Amen."
      },
      "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “2nd Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
